This product bundles a card-issuing SDK (PMSLockCard.exe / PMSLockSDK.dll) that was
written from scratch by this project's author after reverse engineering the card
format and the serial protocol. It is original code, released under the same
license as the rest of this repository.

The vendor reader driver (LC32RFRW.dll) is shipped alongside for interoperability
with the hardware it was built for. It is not covered by this project's copyright
